cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or framework, please cite it as below."
title: "Impact of Weather Conditions for Precise Estimation of Energy Production and Consumption Using Machine Learning Models: A Comparative Study of Deep Learning and Ensemble Approaches"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible framework for quantifying the contribution of meteorological
  information to the estimation of energy production and consumption, and for
  comparing traditional, ensemble and deep-learning approaches under an
  identical time-aware protocol with weather-feature ablation.
